  "term": "assessment of intelligence",
  "definition": "Assessment of intelligence is the effort to measure a person’s mental ability in a reliable and objective way. In the supplied source, it is described mainly as estimating mental speed, such as how quickly someone processes information during simple cognitive tasks.",
